{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ph6GgzmX7R1794794949.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今日天氣提提你：</p><p></p><p>一股偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。<br/><br/>本港地區今日天氣預測:<br/>部分時間有陽光。晚上大致多雲，有一兩陣微雨。吹和緩偏東風，稍後離岸風勢間中清勁。<br/><br/>展望: 明日短暫時間有陽光。星期三北風增強，稍後氣溫顯著下降。本週後期早晚天氣清涼。</p><p></p><p>今日天氣預告由專治屙嘔肚痛嘅李萬山脾胃丸帶俾你。</p><p></p><p>09:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T02:51:02.854097+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T22:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T18:14:54.839966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T02:44:27.311557+00:00","content_hash":"4462754cd8b3478ec2cb247fa7ea6b25353e5878b609ee81166d1bb32f0e6efa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T02:51:02.854097+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}